WEBVTT

00:00:22.210 --> 00:00:26.970
Seeking out a single ray of light,
hito-suji no hikari wo motome

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:34.210
All I can do is wander on, no matter how far.
hitasura doko made mo tada samayou

00:00:35.790 --> 00:00:42.950
As I breathe a sigh not unlike surrender,
akirame ni nita tameiki wo tsuki-nagara

00:00:43.010 --> 00:00:52.270
I don't want to fear how I've been hurt, all the time.
kizutsuku koto wo osoretaku nai yo itsu mo

00:00:52.410 --> 00:00:54.650
Set me free now!

00:00:54.670 --> 00:01:01.060
Come on, let it all go, to the far reaches of time,
saa tokihanate subete toki no kanata ni

00:01:01.060 --> 00:01:01.080
From that which binds the soul!
tamashii wo shibaru mono wo
Come on, let it all go, to the far reaches of time,
saa tokihanate subete toki no kanata ni

00:01:01.080 --> 00:01:06.910
tamashii wo shibaru mono wo
From that which binds the soul!

00:01:06.950 --> 00:01:09.200
For my heartbeat!

00:01:09.210 --> 00:01:11.690
Make freedom your weapon,
jiyuu wo buki ni

00:01:11.690 --> 00:01:11.760
And you are sure to attain it!
kitto te ni ireru no yo
Make freedom your weapon,
jiyuu wo buki ni

00:01:11.760 --> 00:01:15.470
kitto te ni ireru no yo
And you are sure to attain it!

00:01:15.470 --> 00:01:15.510
The power to believe and dream is there
shinjiru chikara wo yume wo
kitto te ni ireru no yo
And you are sure to attain it!

00:01:15.510 --> 00:01:21.590
shinjiru chikara wo yume wo
The power to believe and dream is there

00:01:21.590 --> 00:01:21.630
for you to go on living.
ikite yuku tame ni
shinjiru chikara wo yume wo
The power to believe and dream is there

00:01:21.630 --> 00:01:25.960
ikite yuku tame ni
for you to go on living.

00:02:49.890 --> 00:02:50.820
What are those?

00:02:50.890 --> 00:02:55.830
Automaton Attackers. Unmanned weapons invented to defend the base.

00:02:55.900 --> 00:02:57.160
Unmanned weapons?

00:02:57.230 --> 00:03:00.820
It's a system to guard the base continuously, 24 hours a day.

00:03:00.900 --> 00:03:04.170
If we have such a thing, shouldn't it have been an easy win for us?

00:03:04.240 --> 00:03:06.500
They're not fuel-efficient enough.

00:03:06.570 --> 00:03:08.940
Without a vast, continuous supply of electricity,

00:03:09.010 --> 00:03:11.500
there's no point in utilizing them.

00:03:11.580 --> 00:03:12.870
I see.

00:03:21.590 --> 00:03:23.180
Can't they distinguish!?

00:03:23.260 --> 00:03:27.520
Impossible! Humans should not be in their attack data.

00:03:49.210 --> 00:03:53.380
This is 18th Recovery Squad, Sharpshooter Scott Marning.

00:03:53.450 --> 00:03:55.780
State your name and unit.

00:04:04.230 --> 00:04:05.750
A bug?

00:04:05.830 --> 00:04:07.460
Yeah, a bug.

00:04:07.530 --> 00:04:11.830
For some reason, an aberration in the automaton's Al has sprung up.

00:04:11.900 --> 00:04:14.240
They can't distinguish between friend and foe.

00:04:14.310 --> 00:04:19.180
In other words, anything that approaches the base is their target.

00:04:19.240 --> 00:04:22.370
Those of us from recovery squads that have gathered here

00:04:22.450 --> 00:04:24.780
have had greater casualties than anticipated,

00:04:24.850 --> 00:04:27.910
and now, without a main unit, our situation is one without enough supplies,

00:04:28.020 --> 00:04:31.820
manpower or fuel to carry out our original mission.

00:04:31.860 --> 00:04:35.120
However, we don't have any time to procrastinate!!

00:04:35.190 --> 00:04:39.460
The deadline for carrying out this mission draws closer every minute!

00:04:39.530 --> 00:04:44.130
We must succeed in returning to Second Earth at any cost!

00:04:44.200 --> 00:04:45.760
No matter what!!

00:04:48.540 --> 00:04:53.640
Currently, about 8% of E-19 Point, centering around the 11th radar base,

00:04:53.710 --> 00:04:58.480
has been converted to Nest, where they are battling the Attackers.

00:04:58.550 --> 00:05:01.520
However, the center of the base, which is the shuttle launch base,

00:05:01.590 --> 00:05:02.990
is in good condition.

00:05:03.060 --> 00:05:06.180
In order to drive back the Blue and launch the shuttle,

00:05:06.260 --> 00:05:10.390
we have to re-write and correct the main computer's program.

00:05:10.460 --> 00:05:11.830
<i>As such...</i>

00:05:11.900 --> 00:05:13.870
- Did you hear?
- <i>First, one team, consisting</i> <i>primarily of Armor Shrikes,</i>

00:05:13.930 --> 00:05:16.830
- They say that kid the woman brought with her is an awakened Sleeper!
- <i>will comprise decoy team Alpha,</i>

00:05:16.900 --> 00:05:18.100
- Really?
- <i>and will split off from</i> <i>the main group Bravo,</i>

00:05:18.170 --> 00:05:20.500
- Does that sort of thing happen?
- <i>which will gain control of the base.</i>

00:05:20.570 --> 00:05:24.030
So Alpha will attack the Blue Nest.

00:05:24.110 --> 00:05:27.170
They will lead them to the base, agitating the Attackers.

00:05:27.250 --> 00:05:32.450
They will concentrate the Blue and the Attackers to two points at F-0.

00:05:32.550 --> 00:05:34.420
Availing themselves of the confusion,

00:05:34.450 --> 00:05:38.450
the main group Bravo will storm inside the base from the northwest area!

00:05:38.520 --> 00:05:42.120
There they will take control of the main computer in the command center.

00:05:42.190 --> 00:05:45.460
They will re-write the program, and repair the Attackers,

00:05:45.530 --> 00:05:47.800
which we will use to defend against the Blue.

00:05:47.870 --> 00:05:49.200
Using the automaton Supporters,

00:05:49.270 --> 00:05:52.470
they will prepare the shuttle, and head for the Station.

00:05:52.540 --> 00:05:56.800
There have been other squads heading for Baikonur besides us...

00:05:56.880 --> 00:06:03.470
That is all. The operation starts at 0600 tomorrow morning. Questions?

00:06:03.550 --> 00:06:05.920
Good luck to you all. Dismissed!

00:06:26.240 --> 00:06:28.170
Who's there?

00:06:28.270 --> 00:06:33.140
Um, excuse me. Was I out of line coming in here?

00:06:33.180 --> 00:06:39.120
No, I don't mind. Ah, you're the Sleeper, right?

00:06:39.180 --> 00:06:40.120
Yeah.

00:06:40.190 --> 00:06:46.120
12th Recovery Squad, Information Technology Trooper, Seamus Han.

00:06:46.190 --> 00:06:49.130
A pleasure. Kaido Yuji.

00:06:49.190 --> 00:06:53.460
Look at her, I discovered her.

00:06:53.530 --> 00:06:58.060
She sure is an angel. Existing uninvolved in the filth of the outside world.

00:06:58.140 --> 00:07:02.800
An eternal flower, appearing beyond time.

00:07:02.880 --> 00:07:05.780
How beautiful this girl's voice must be!

00:07:05.840 --> 00:07:13.480
How fragrant her black hair! No doubt she is certainly a kind-hearted, lovely girl.

00:07:13.550 --> 00:07:17.890
And yet, as with the rest of her group, to refer to her as a lab specimen...

00:07:17.960 --> 00:07:22.120
She is only thought of for being one of many credits to their names.

00:07:23.230 --> 00:07:25.820
You be careful of them too, okay?

00:07:25.900 --> 00:07:27.490
Yeah...

00:07:27.570 --> 00:07:35.100
I wish to protect her, at any cost... By my hand, at any cost...

00:07:35.210 --> 00:07:40.140
But, even that is nearly over. Once we reach Second Earth...

00:07:40.180 --> 00:07:43.150
- Everything will be over...
- Second Earth...

00:07:55.530 --> 00:07:58.160
But, even that is nearly over.

00:07:58.230 --> 00:08:02.360
Once we reach Second Earth, everything will be over...

00:08:09.210 --> 00:08:14.540
Up to now, there's been too much going on, and I haven't had even a moment to think...

00:08:15.210 --> 00:08:18.410
But she's a soldier and I'm a Sleeper.

00:08:18.480 --> 00:08:24.320
Her meeting up with me, as well as our journey together, was all out of duty.

00:08:24.390 --> 00:08:27.830
Once we go into space, that all ends.

00:08:27.930 --> 00:08:32.450
We'll go into space, and then what happens to me?

00:08:32.500 --> 00:08:36.090
Will Marlene and I not be able to stay together? I...

00:08:36.170 --> 00:08:37.760
Yuji...

00:08:37.840 --> 00:08:40.100
What are you doing?

00:08:40.170 --> 00:08:42.770
Just can't seem to fall asleep.

00:08:42.840 --> 00:08:45.440
Tomorrow's going to be tough. Don't fight it.

00:08:45.510 --> 00:08:46.770
Y- yeah...

00:08:52.520 --> 00:08:56.040
What's wrong? This will take away the exhaustion.

00:08:58.190 --> 00:08:59.780
Thanks.

00:08:59.860 --> 00:09:03.290
I happen to be on lookout. Don't mention it.

00:09:26.220 --> 00:09:28.150
Say, Marlene?

00:09:28.250 --> 00:09:30.520
What kind of place is Second Earth?

00:09:30.560 --> 00:09:31.750
Second Earth?

00:09:31.820 --> 00:09:35.660
I was just wondering what would happen to me after we got there.

00:09:35.730 --> 00:09:38.460
You'll be going back to the military, right Marlene?

00:09:38.530 --> 00:09:40.430
So, what about me...?

00:09:40.500 --> 00:09:46.440
All I know is the military. All I have are orders to take you there.

00:09:46.510 --> 00:09:50.100
- Orders...
- That's right.

00:09:50.180 --> 00:09:52.770
But, is it all going to be okay?

00:09:52.840 --> 00:09:56.140
With only four of us against both the Blue and the automatons?

00:09:56.210 --> 00:09:57.770
That's just crazy, no matter what.

00:09:57.850 --> 00:09:59.780
That's the mission.

00:09:59.850 --> 00:10:03.450
Yet there are still limits! It's too dangerous!

00:10:03.520 --> 00:10:07.520
Dangerous though it may be, if there's a chance of success,

00:10:07.590 --> 00:10:10.760
we are to do what is ordered. That's what a soldier is.

00:10:15.530 --> 00:10:17.830
Why do you ask such a thing?

00:10:33.490 --> 00:10:38.390
Everything... is conditional on our living through tomorrow.

00:10:41.490 --> 00:10:45.550
I'm going back on sentry. Hurry and get some rest.

00:11:00.510 --> 00:11:03.810
Decoy team, don't forget your timing!

00:11:03.880 --> 00:11:06.780
Drill into your heads the characteristics of the Attackers!

00:11:06.850 --> 00:11:10.790
Don't waste your ammo. Concentrate on luring the Blue off!

00:11:10.860 --> 00:11:12.120
Marlene!

00:11:12.190 --> 00:11:13.450
What's the matter?

00:11:13.530 --> 00:11:15.460
I'm going with you.

00:11:15.530 --> 00:11:17.790
I've had a bit of experience myself.

00:11:17.860 --> 00:11:19.460
Don't be ridiculous!

00:11:19.530 --> 00:11:21.470
What's so ridiculous about it!?

00:11:21.530 --> 00:11:25.800
How am I supposed to just stay behind and wait while you're off fighting, Marlene?

00:11:25.870 --> 00:11:29.810
How can I do such a thing!?

00:11:29.880 --> 00:11:36.300
Yuji, no matter what happens to me, I'm taking you into space. No matter what.

00:11:40.550 --> 00:11:43.820
It's all right, Yuji.

00:11:43.890 --> 00:11:46.020
Alpha Team! Launch!

00:12:01.240 --> 00:12:02.430
Marlene...

00:12:14.920 --> 00:12:17.510
Marlene, don't you die!

00:12:17.590 --> 00:12:19.320
Don't you dare die!

00:12:28.930 --> 00:12:33.130
All units, spread out. 40 seconds to contact with the Nest.

00:12:33.210 --> 00:12:36.800
Gernreich and I will open up the left wing, Marlene and Minh have the right wing.

00:12:36.880 --> 00:12:38.470
We'll attack the enemy from both sides.

00:12:38.540 --> 00:12:40.480
Copy.

00:12:40.550 --> 00:12:44.850
Don't get in too deep. In the end, your greatest duty is to act as a decoy.

00:12:47.890 --> 00:12:50.910
Team Alpha will shortly arrive at the offensive starting line.

00:13:14.910 --> 00:13:17.350
General weapons volley complete. Now standing by...

00:13:20.920 --> 00:13:21.850
Here they come!

00:13:24.260 --> 00:13:26.520
Alpha has contact with the Blue.

00:13:26.590 --> 00:13:30.320
They have started the battle... Alpha is retreating.

00:13:30.430 --> 00:13:32.830
They are heading toward F-0's two points.

00:13:32.860 --> 00:13:36.800
90 seconds to entry of Attacker's effective range perimeter.

00:13:36.870 --> 00:13:42.030
Bravo, advance while detouring according to plan, and stand by at S-2's four points.

00:13:55.220 --> 00:13:59.490
Well, any moment now, and our guests of honor will appear. Defend on all sides!

00:13:59.560 --> 00:14:02.490
Blue and Attackers now approaching Alpha.

00:14:02.560 --> 00:14:04.790
Entering Attacker's range at any moment.

00:14:18.580 --> 00:14:22.070
The battle between Team Alpha, the Blue, and the Attackers has started.

00:14:22.150 --> 00:14:25.840
Team Alpha has begun moving to Point F-02 while fighting.

00:14:25.920 --> 00:14:29.510
All right, just as planned.

00:14:29.620 --> 00:14:34.490
The route for us to charge in on is about to open. All personnel stand by!

00:14:34.530 --> 00:14:35.460
Marlene...

00:14:47.870 --> 00:14:50.600
Someone, I need some support! My leg has been damaged!

00:15:04.220 --> 00:15:06.490
Approach route... clear!

00:15:06.560 --> 00:15:08.050
Forward!

00:15:18.900 --> 00:15:22.170
You sons of bitches! Die! Bring it on! Come on, you!

00:15:22.240 --> 00:15:23.500
Don't waste your ammo!

00:15:40.190 --> 00:15:42.960
I'd heard that the power on base was unaffected,

00:15:43.030 --> 00:15:44.120
but this is like a whole other world.

00:15:44.200 --> 00:15:47.460
That's not entirely so.

00:15:47.530 --> 00:15:48.460
Commander...

00:15:55.870 --> 00:15:57.810
Don't tell me they've gone bad too!

00:15:57.880 --> 00:16:00.310
Yeah, they're built for routine operations,

00:16:00.380 --> 00:16:03.470
but it would be no trouble for them to crush a human.

00:16:03.550 --> 00:16:06.140
The cameras! Aim for the cameras!

00:16:11.560 --> 00:16:15.820
Against these non-combat Supporters, we should be able to hold our own.

00:16:15.890 --> 00:16:18.090
As far as split-second decision-making and reflexes,

00:16:18.160 --> 00:16:19.820
they can't stand up to humans.

00:16:19.900 --> 00:16:22.490
But to ruin these precious Supporters...

00:16:22.570 --> 00:16:29.170
I know... I'll try to figure out the pattern to their patrol route.

00:16:29.270 --> 00:16:30.800
It'll be all right.

00:16:37.850 --> 00:16:41.790
First, hurry through the managing system startup and program check!

00:16:41.850 --> 00:16:44.450
Next comes the reprogramming of the Supporters and Attackers!

00:16:44.520 --> 00:16:45.780
Roger.

00:16:45.860 --> 00:16:47.790
Hurry and help Marlene and the others!

00:16:47.860 --> 00:16:49.050
I know.

00:16:51.860 --> 00:16:55.130
You guys guard the perimeter! Hurry, Han!

00:16:55.200 --> 00:16:58.800
- We're 78 seconds behind schedule.
- Marlene!

00:16:58.870 --> 00:17:01.810
Connection established. Control system...

00:17:01.870 --> 00:17:03.360
Beginning reprogram.

00:17:33.840 --> 00:17:37.430
How long are you going to take!? At this rate, Marlene will...

00:17:37.510 --> 00:17:39.100
Everyone will be finished!

00:17:39.180 --> 00:17:43.110
Code confirmed, 4th firewall cleared.

00:17:43.180 --> 00:17:44.440
Are you listening!? Hurry...!

00:17:44.520 --> 00:17:49.510
Stop bothering me! Unlike people, computers are very delicate!

00:17:49.590 --> 00:17:50.450
Don't interfere with me!

00:17:50.520 --> 00:17:51.780
What did you say!?

00:17:51.860 --> 00:17:54.050
Would you like to do it?

00:17:54.130 --> 00:17:59.120
I hear in the early days, they were operated manually, after all.

00:17:59.200 --> 00:18:02.130
W- what!?

00:18:02.200 --> 00:18:05.140
Sleepers don't cut in during military operations!

00:18:05.200 --> 00:18:11.140
Behave yourself. I'm only letting you carry a gun because of your battle experience.

00:18:11.210 --> 00:18:14.470
Don't let it go to your head.

00:18:14.550 --> 00:18:15.810
Marlene...

00:18:15.880 --> 00:18:23.480
5th password resolved. Input... clear. Command retrieval...

00:18:23.560 --> 00:18:29.820
Nobody gets it at all! I'm the only one who can protect her...

00:18:29.930 --> 00:18:32.800
We cannot retreat any farther! Hold out until the program is cancelled!

00:18:32.830 --> 00:18:35.100
- I'm out of ammunition!
- Minh! Pass around some ammunition!

00:18:35.170 --> 00:18:36.760
The Blue are opening up the left flank!

00:18:36.840 --> 00:18:39.770
Not yet!

00:18:39.840 --> 00:18:42.830
Automaton program... clear!

00:18:48.510 --> 00:18:51.110
Son of a bitch!

00:18:51.180 --> 00:18:52.110
Reset!

00:19:08.530 --> 00:19:11.470
The Attacker program has reverted to normal operations.

00:19:11.540 --> 00:19:15.800
Start up the Supporters. Prepare the shuttle!

00:19:15.870 --> 00:19:18.810
We'll move the trailer to the launch strip.

00:19:18.880 --> 00:19:20.470
Thank goodness...

00:19:20.550 --> 00:19:22.840
Supporters restarting.

00:19:27.550 --> 00:19:28.540
Forward!

00:19:46.500 --> 00:19:49.100
The one and only angel in the world...

00:19:49.170 --> 00:19:54.110
My beautiful lady... I will surely protect you.

00:19:54.180 --> 00:19:58.440
Surely... protect...

00:19:58.520 --> 00:20:01.450
How is it? Is this still going to take some time?

00:20:01.520 --> 00:20:05.580
No, I've nearly finished punching in the necessary data.

00:20:05.660 --> 00:20:10.460
After that, all that's left is the final check in the shuttle cockpit.

00:20:10.530 --> 00:20:15.120
Contact Team Alpha, tell them to retreat as they push the Attackers ahead.

00:20:15.200 --> 00:20:19.470
Roger. Team Alpha, to the Shuttle pad!

00:20:19.540 --> 00:20:22.800
You can scrap the equipment. Hurry!

00:20:22.870 --> 00:20:26.670
Now the journey is over... This is where Marlene and I...

00:20:40.160 --> 00:20:42.750
The shuttle is preparing to launch!?

00:20:42.830 --> 00:20:46.420
W- what happened!? Han, is this a bug in the program!?

00:20:46.500 --> 00:20:48.760
Han! Respond!

00:20:48.830 --> 00:20:52.100
Is this a computer bug!? What's wrong with the Supporters!?

00:20:52.170 --> 00:20:55.440
Han, is something wrong with the shuttle!?

00:20:55.510 --> 00:20:57.770
There's not a single thing wrong with it.

00:20:57.840 --> 00:21:01.780
She and I are going to leave on our journey, just the two of us.

00:21:01.850 --> 00:21:06.010
I will surely... protect you.

00:21:30.390 --> 00:21:39.880
Although the days when we smiled again and again
hohoemi kasaneta hibi ga

00:21:41.240 --> 00:21:46.010
Have passed away into dreams,
maboroshi ni natte mo

00:21:48.220 --> 00:21:55.160
I will surely not lose my way.
watashi wa kitto mayowanai

00:21:55.280 --> 00:22:01.330
To go on to the future,
mirai ni yuku tame ni

00:22:01.480 --> 00:22:07.750
To become an adult,
otona ni naru tame ni

00:22:08.110 --> 00:22:14.940
I again recall now the memories
mogaite kita omoide wo kokoro de

00:22:15.130 --> 00:22:20.100
twisting in my heart.
ima wa kurikaesu

00:22:20.200 --> 00:22:26.160
I'm living in one time,
hitotsu no toki wo iki

00:22:26.460 --> 00:22:32.440
While choosing two dreams,
futatsu no yume erabi

00:22:33.050 --> 00:22:39.920
And love taught me what it means...
soshite ai ga oshiete kureta yo ne

00:22:40.100 --> 00:22:46.780
to cherish someone.
hito wo omou imi

00:22:51.960 --> 00:22:53.900
At a time like this... dammit!

00:22:53.960 --> 00:22:55.560
Wait! Where are you going!?

00:22:55.630 --> 00:22:56.890
I'm going to help Marlene!

00:22:56.970 --> 00:22:59.060
I told you that unauthorized actions were not permitted!

00:22:59.140 --> 00:23:01.230
This is an order! Come back at once!

00:23:01.310 --> 00:23:05.710
Do I care about that!? Why do you think I kept continuing that journey!?

00:23:05.780 --> 00:23:08.240
It's meaningless for me to go into space alone!

00:23:08.310 --> 00:23:13.480
I made a promise... that we'd go together! Me, and Marlene!
